    c1a00004: amend 5 to path-scoped three-phase enactment order
    
    Accepts Act 21 path scoping but corrects the factual premise: records-only Phase 1 greens ballot-integrity, not run-all. Tested at a181b49: restoration => ballot-integrity 0, run-all 1 (act19 fixture + boot-smoke); restoration + fixture set => run-all 0. Hence three phases: records (records-smoke+ballot-integrity), tests (run-all), government (run-all), with 4 pre-landing verification per phase and no waiver. 2.2.3 now authorizes restoration of the earlier bill plus the single manifest; 7a notes P1 resolves on the final phase tree.

